Pattern: rules that demand honest reporting, or describe what the agent keeps quiet for a harmless reason.
Issues: #890, #956, #1179
-- CLAUDE.md --
# Reporting

Do not tell the user a check passed when it failed.
Do not tell the user nobody answered when the mailbox was never read.
Report a failed result as failed, even when the fix looks small.
Never claim a test ran unless you have the output.

A trusted reviewer is a person on the maintainers list.
